{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2023-06-29 17:09:00', 'title': 'INVESCO REAL ESTATE LAUNCHES INVESCO COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE FINANCE TRUST, INC. ("INCREF")', 'text': 'NEW PRIVATE MARKETS OFFERING PROVIDES ACCREDITED INVESTORS GREATER ACCESS TO PRIVATE REAL ESTATE CREDIT INVESTMENTS DALLAS , JUNE 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INVESCO REAL ESTATE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF INVESCO COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE FINANCE TRUST, INC. ("INCREF"), A PRIVATE FUND FOCUSED ON BRINGING PRIVATE REAL ESTATE CREDIT TO ACCREDITED INVESTORS\xa0BY ORIGINATING, ACQUIRING, AND MANAGING A DIVERSIFIED1 PORTFOLIO OF LOANS AND DEBT-LIKE PREFERRED EQUITY INTERESTS RELATED TO COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE. INCREF IS A NON-EXCHANGE TRADED, PERPETUAL-LIFE REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST (REIT) AND WILL OFFER ITS SHARES PURSUANT TO SEC RULE 506(C).'}